        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-700">Manual processes eating into your productive time</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-700">Complexities with international payments and taxes</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">As a freelancer, you need a reliable ally to tackle these hurdles head-on. <strong class="text-dark">That's where Invoice Ninja steps in.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== IMAGINE A WORLD WHERE ==================== -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 via-blue-50 to-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-10">Imagine A World Where...</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-primary mx-auto mb-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark">Payments are prompt and reliable</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-primary mx-auto mb-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.307a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.519l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.28m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" /></svg>
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark">Income is steady and predictable</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-primary mx-auto mb-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.594 3.94c.09-.542.56-.94 1.11-.94h2.593c.55 0 1.02.398 1.11.94l.213 1.281c.063.374.313.686.645.87.074.04.147.083.22.127.324.196.72.257 1.075.124l1.217-.456a1.125 1.125 0 011.37.49l1.296 2.247a1.125 1.125 0 01-.26 1.431l-1.003.827c-.293.24-.438.613-.431.992a6.759 6.759 0 010 .255c-.007.378.138.75.43.99l1.005.828c.424.35.534.954.26 1.43l-1.298 2.247a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.369.491l-1.217-.456c-.355-.133-.75-.072-1.076.124a6.57 6.57 0 01-.22.128c-.331.183-.581.495-.644.869l-.213 1.28c-.09.543-.56.941-1.11.941h-2.594c-.55 0-1.02-.398-1.11-.94l-.213-1.281c-.062-.374-.312-.686-.644-.87a6.52 6.52 0 01-.22-.127c-.325-.196-.72-.257-1.076-.124l-1.217.456a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.369-.49l-1.297-2.247a1.125 1.125 0 01.26-1.431l1.004-.827c.292-.24.437-.613.43-.992a6.932 6.932 0 010-.255c.007-.378-.138-.75-.43-.99l-1.004-.828a1.125 1.125 0 01-.26-1.43l1.297-2.247a1.125 1.125 0 011.37-.491l1.216.456c.356.133.751.072 1.076-.124.072-.044.146-.087.22-.128.332-.183.582-.495.644-.869l.214-1.281z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /></svg>
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark">Invoicing is efficient and automated</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== SOCIAL PROOF: PRESS QUOTES ==================== -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-dark">200,000+ businesses rely on Invoice Ninja</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4">
            {[1,2,3,4,5].map(() => (
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" /></svg>
